    "detailed_description": "In this 2D bullet hell shooter, you will fight through endless rooms of enemies, gain powerups, and fight difficult bosses.  Each room presents a new challenge, with many room layouts and enemy patterns that keep the gameplay fresh and unpredictable. As you progress, you'll discover a variety of items, each offering unique abilities and strategies. The game's fast-paced action and tight controls ensure that every encounter is intense and rewarding.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Dynamic Combat: Face off against rooms of enemies with different attack patterns and behaviors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Power-Up System: Collect and combine various power-ups to enhance your weapons and abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Challenging Boss Fights: Test your skills against powerful bosses, each with their own distinct moves and tactics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Endless Levels: Endless mode lets you keep playing forever.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Retro Aesthetic: Enjoy a vibrant, pixel-art style inspired by classic arcade shooters.",
